<title>USA: Merrill acquires rest of S. African broker.</title>
<headline>Merrill acquires rest of S. African broker.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc said Tuesday it reached an agreement in principle with Smith Borkum Hare (Pty) Ltd to acquire the 49 percent of the South African securities firm it does not already own.</p>
<p>Merrill acquired 51 percent of the company in November 1995.</p>
<p>The firm, one of the largest securities dealers in South Africa, will continue to operate under the Smith Borkum Hare name, said Merrill.  Terms of the aquisition, which is subject to regulatory approval, were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
